# MigrationPilot Environment Variables

# Org plan license key (optional). Turns on the config's policy block and
# audit log; every rule runs without one. `migrationpilot doctor` shows the
# plan and expiry.
# MIGRATIONPILOT_LICENSE_KEY=MP-v2-ORG-20271231-abc123...

# Production database, read-only, for the rules that read table size and traffic
# (free, like every rule)
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@host:5432/dbname

# Billing (Vercel serverless only — not needed for CLI)
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
# STRIPE_PRICE_ORG=price_...
# STRIPE_PRICE_PRO=price_...
# STRIPE_PRICE_TEAM=price_...
# STRIPE_PRICE_ENTERPRISE=price_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# EMAIL_FROM=MigrationPilot <noreply@migrationpilot.dev>
# SITE_URL=https://migrationpilot.dev

# NOTE: For Resend email delivery to work, you must verify your domain
# (migrationpilot.dev) in the Resend dashboard and add the required
# DNS records (SPF, DKIM, DMARC). Without this, emails from
# noreply@migrationpilot.dev will be rejected by email providers.

# License key generation (Stripe webhook only). The Ed25519 private key (PEM)
# that matches CURRENT_KEY_VERSION in src/license/public-keys.ts.
# MIGRATIONPILOT_SIGNING_PRIVATE_KEY=your-production-ed25519-private-key
